# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Echo — environment templates live inside each app:
#
#   • Backend  →  apps/api/.env.example   →  copy to  apps/api/.env
#   • Frontend →  apps/web/.env.example   →  copy to  apps/web/.env.local
#
# This root file is intentionally minimal. See docs/ENVIRONMENT.md
# for the full reference of every variable Echo uses.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
